### Hello world
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### List all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### List only finished tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?done=true

### List only open tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?done=false

### Get a single task
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/1

### Create a task (201 + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try NestJS"
}

### Mark a task as done
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### Rename a task
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn TypeScript properly"
}

### Delete a task (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/1

### --- Error cases ----------------------------------------------------------

### Blank title (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   "
}

### Title longer than 100 characters (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
}

### Invalid JSON (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": 

### Invalid done value (400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": "yes"
}

### Invalid done filter (400)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?done=maybe

### Unknown task (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/999

### Non-numeric id (400)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/abc

### --- Live ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Live: stream all task events as Server-Sent Events (keep it open, then create/delete tasks)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/events
Accept: text/event-stream

### Live: WebSocket – IntelliJ opens an interactive console; type a title to create a task
WEBSOCKET ws://localhost:8080/ws/tasks

### Live: browser demo page
GET http://localhost:8080/live/
